{
  "id": "solubility",
  "title": "Solubility Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate the concentration of saturated solutions based on solubility data. This tool helps determine weight percentage (wt%) concentration of solutions given the solute mass, solvent mass, and solubility limits.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Solubility Calculator\n\n**Solubility** is the maximum amount of solute that can dissolve in a given amount of solvent at a specific temperature. This calculator determines the concentration (wt%) of solutions based on solubility data.\n\n### Key Concepts:\n- A **saturated solution** contains the maximum amount of solute possible in the solvent\n- Solubility varies with temperature (generally increases with temperature)\n- If you add more solute than the solubility allows, only the amount specified by solubility will dissolve\n\n### Formula:\n**Concentration (wt%) = (solute mass / total solution mass) × 100%**\n\nWhere total solution mass = solute mass + solvent mass"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "solute_mass",
          "label": "Solute Mass Added",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "g",
          "defaultValue": 36
        },
        {
          "id": "solvent_mass",
          "label": "Solvent Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "g",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "max_solubility",
          "label": "Maximum Solubility",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "g",
          "defaultValue": 36
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "actual_dissolved",
          "label": "Actual Solute Dissolved",
          "formula": "Math.min(inputs.solute_mass, inputs.max_solubility)",
          "unit": "g"
        },
        {
          "id": "undissolved",
          "label": "Undissolved Solute",
          "formula": "Math.max(0, inputs.solute_mass - inputs.max_solubility)",
          "unit": "g"
        },
        {
          "id": "solution_mass",
          "label": "Total Solution Mass",
          "formula": "inputs.actual_dissolved + inputs.solvent_mass",
          "unit": "g"
        },
        {
          "id": "concentration_wt",
          "label": "Concentration (wt%)",
          "formula": "(inputs.actual_dissolved / (inputs.actual_dissolved + inputs.solvent_mass)) * 100",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Scenario",
        "Solute Added (g)",
        "Max Solubility (g)",
        "Solvent (g)",
        "Dissolved (g)",
        "Undissolved (g)",
        "Concentration (wt%)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Example 1: Saturated NaCl",
          "36",
          "36",
          "100",
          "36",
          "0",
          "26.5"
        ],
        [
          "Example 2: Unsaturated NaCl",
          "34",
          "36",
          "100",
          "34",
          "0",
          "25.4"
        ],
        [
          "Example 3: Oversaturated NaCl",
          "38",
          "36",
          "100",
          "36",
          "2",
          "26.5"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Solubility Analysis",
          "left": "center"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Solubility Limit",
            "Solute Added",
            "Dissolved Amount"
          ]
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Example 1\n(Saturated)",
            "Example 2\n(Unsaturated)",
            "Example 3\n(Oversaturated)"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Mass (g)"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Solubility Limit",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [
              36,
              36,
              36
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#FF6B6B"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Solute Added",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              36,
              34,
              38
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#4ECDC4"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Dissolved Amount",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              36,
              34,
              36
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#95E1D3"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}